; The order of a day across files. Directives of one day at one time keep the order the load reads them in: the main
; file whole, then the files it includes. A budget defined in an included file takes the postings of that day read after
; its definition: not those of the main file, written above or below the include, nor those above it in its own file.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Food

2024-03-10 * "A" "midnight, main file, above the include"
  Expenses:Food 1 CNY
  Assets:Bank

include "budgets.zhang"

2024-03-10 * "D" "midnight, main file, below the include"
  Expenses:Food 8 CNY
  Assets:Bank
